  "title": "DIS: fix stream jitter calculation",
  "description": "This follow-up fixes DIS stream jitter reporting so that it reflects variation in transit time rather than mirroring packet spacing.\n\nThe updated logic retains the RTP-style filtered jitter calculation, but falls back to media-derived packet timing when DIS transmit timestamps appear unreliable for a radio stream.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes [Codex]",
